{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider equations of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/48240238b0a7255fd48482f895e8cb2149ca9b8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + bx + c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" />. How many such equations have real roots and have coefficients <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> selected \nfrom the set of integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e954649eaeea5e9f301c66fa9aca8c0dee5b003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3, 4, 5,6\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e584cc8f81e86d5d44a8735470fd31fc5d8208f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 20 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 19 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 17 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discriminant\" title=\"Discriminant\">discriminant</a> of the quadratic is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/9/2799874bde49c155af2f8a91bfdfd2494d0e158d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 - 4c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"15\" />.  Since the quadratic has real roots,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8ac7b84828b69af04e1ea259125765c720efd0cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^2 - 4c \\ge 0\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/2/172b0f9038eeb9303443c6343202cc986bdd7259.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^2 \\ge 4c\\]\" width=\"56\" height=\"17\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b4072cb7de18361e960cfe836e16456d1dd1ae2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 6$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can be from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0bf97955f4eedafea7db58ac66eb4a130baa2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can also be from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5328bc4703ff88e62aa83ea58ae4e8361f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can be from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626beed3a7eee094ce4b6cf79a49d81669f72d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can only be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/851b03ce92c3ad8da97daf2785cf4e103c7a8d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, no values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> in the set would work.\n</p><p>Thus, there are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> equations that work.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a